{{Distinguish|Template:Para|Template:Parameter}}

This template is for giving examples of template parameter source code which is useful in template documentation and talk page discussions of template code.

== Usage ==
* <code><nowiki>{{param|foo}}</nowiki></code> → {{param|foo}}
* <code><nowiki>{{param|foo|tag=kbd}}</nowiki></code> &rarr; {{param|foo|tag=kbd}}
* <code><nowiki>{{param|foo|bar}}</nowiki></code> → {{param|foo|bar}}
* <code><nowiki>{{param|foo|{{param|bar|nested=1}}}}</nowiki></code> → {{param|foo|{{param|bar|nested=1}}}}
* <code><nowiki>{{param|foo|{{param|bar|{{param|baz|derp|nested=1}}|nested=1}}}}</nowiki></code> → {{param|foo|{{param|bar|{{param|baz|derp|nested=1}}|nested=1}}}}

=== Examples involving {{tlx|para}} ===
* <code><nowiki>{{para|foo|{{param|bar}}}}</nowiki></code> → {{para|foo|{{param|bar}}}}
* <code><nowiki>{{para|foo|{{param|bar|nested=1}}}}</nowiki></code> → {{para|foo|{{param|bar|nested=1}}}}
* <code><nowiki>{{para|foo}}{{param|bar}}</nowiki></code> → {{para|foo}}{{param|bar}}
* <code><nowiki>{{para|foo|{{var|bar}}}}</nowiki></code> → {{para|foo|{{var|bar}}}}

